# Pulsar layer change
#
# Stop the bead, retract, do the UR travel move, unretract, resume flow.
# The screw is still spinning behind the M221 S0 — flow modulation, not
# motor stop, is the cleanest way to break the bead between layers.

pulsar_flow_off()
pulsar_retract(3.0, 600)

# --- UR travel move(s) here ---
# e.g. movel(p[..], a=1.0, v=0.05, r=0)

pulsar_unretract(3.0, 600)
pulsar_flow_on(100)
